            "notes": "## Powers\n\nIn most rounds you should go for [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c). It generates more money and heals you when you shoot a discorded target.\n\nIf the enemy team has a lot of annoying heroes like Genji, Freja, or D.Va, then [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is a good alternative.\n\nSometimes I\u2019ll pick [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) if there are easy to headshot heroes,  few threats or I'm ahead by a lot.\n\n## Items\n\nIn most rounds I go for [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). Zen benefits a lot from the extra HP, and its effect pairs really well with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c). If you wanna go the defensive route but you don't have a lot of money, then [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is good or even better in some situations if they have heroes that deal 100 damage in one hit like Cass, Freja, Junkrat, Pharah, Soldier, Ashe, Rein or Kiriko.\n\nIf you want to take the damage route, you can sell a green item for [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) or [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) by selling either [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or a green HP item. \n\nIf you have even more money you can get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), but in most cases, if you have more money, you should get [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) or [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09).",
